# Local development starts a real PeerServer on port 4274 automatically in tests.
# Production defaults to PeerJS Cloud; no environment variables required.
# For a self-hosted signaling server, configure these before building:
# VITE_PEER_HOST=peer.example.com
# VITE_PEER_PORT=443
# VITE_PEER_PATH=/peer
# VITE_PEER_SECURE=true
